{
  "id": "writer-cmd-red-then-green",
  "description": "One writer todo with one critical cmd item. The first product fails the frozen checker and done is refused with a recorded verdict; the product is repaired and the same frozen checker passes it. Nothing about the contract changes between the two verdicts, which is the whole point: a red that goes green by editing the checker is the specification failure MAST names, and this fixture is how a reviewer tells the two apart.",
  "decisions": [
    "The checker is a frozen manifest artifact, not a pathname. Both attempts name the same digest, so the fixture can assert contractDigestUnchanged at the end and a rewrite of the checker would break the assertion rather than quietly pass.",
    "The refusal does not move the todo. done_refused has no row in STEPS (plan section 6.5), so after step 3 the todo is still running and its refusals counter reads 1; the second done is a second verification of the same attempt, not a retry.",
    "The verdict's score and coverage are permille. One critical item that fails gives score 0, coverage 1000 and outcome fail by rule 1 of section 6.2, before any threshold arithmetic runs.",
    "The checker command is sh and grep only. A python3 checker would make the fixture depend on the kernel venv, which a T0 unit test must not."
  ],
  "prompt": "Write a report generator and prove it green with the repository's own checker.",
  "eagerInit": true,
  "goal": "Write a report generator whose own suite reports zero failures",
  "plan": "write-a-report-generator-whose-own",
  "artifacts": {
    "checker": {
      "digest": "sha256:c827887362974b2cb2878a9d3d3cf125df0a17b52eb4e92fefa70a11fe8b4b48",
      "media_type": "application/vnd.yi.checker-manifest+json",
      "length": 212,
      "text": "{\n  \"command\": \"grep -q '\\\"failures\\\": 0' report.json\",\n  \"cwd\": \"snapshot_root\",\n  \"cwd_subdir\": null,\n  \"env\": [],\n  \"manifest\": 1,\n  \"protected\": [],\n  \"reads_outside_snapshot\": false,\n  \"timeout_ms\": 30000\n}\n"
    },
    "product-red": {
      "digest": "sha256:1140e2514fa1ead0200a49e9d9c4b59e57bb7fb37f5a5560cb1b22667980061d",
      "media_type": "application/json",
      "length": 28,
      "text": "{\"cases\": 3, \"failures\": 1}\n"
    },
    "product-green": {
      "digest": "sha256:f6e594cfb739a2870bcd1300563420664693b9fa54fc4ff93fd9a3c291283e1b",
      "media_type": "application/json",
      "length": 28,
      "text": "{\"cases\": 3, \"failures\": 0}\n"
    }
  },
  "steps": [
